    "body": "It sounds like the issue is that websites aren't using `inputmode` and `autocomplete` simply because they aren't as obvious as `type`, which I don't think is a very strong argument for adding a new value for `type`, especially since this is a very particular use case for a particular type of ID rather than extremely widespread and fundamental ideas like `number` and `email`.\r\n\r\nPerhaps we should do some sort of outreach to make these features more well known to web developers instead?\r\n\r\nI'd still like to know more about exactly how we can improve `autocomplete` and/or autofill for this use case.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
