    "updated_at": "2020-07-20T21:56:31Z",
    "body": "We could add a new [autofill field](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#autofill-field), e.g. `autocomplete=\"citizen-id-number\"`. The issue is getting browsers to implement it. Is a browser going to open a dialog on installation asking people to type their citizen ID number, so that it can autofill it for them on a few select government sites? I find that doubtful...",
