    "body": "Please, consider other names like `national-identification-number` or `\"nin\"` ([national identification number](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_identification_number)) because its more open to other identifications; like: citizens, permanent and temporary residents (emigrants)...\r\n\r\n+1 to implement new input type (e.g.` type=\"nin\"`).",
